###  http://example.org/multimodal-taxonomy#mapping_001
:mapping_001 rdf:type :AnalogicalMapping ;
                rdfs:label "The man with blood is mapped as the speaker of the joke"@en ;
                rdfs:comment "The visual of the distressed man with blood is mapped onto the textual entity 'my wife asked me where i'd like to be buried', implying that the man is the 'me' in the question. The text sets up a scenario where the speaker (the man) is being asked a serious question, and his subsequent inappropriate response is the punchline. The visual of the man's distress and injury serves as the embodiment of the speaker who is caught in the absurd and taboo situation described in the text."@en ;
                :extractionMethod "llm_extraction_huggingface" ;
                :extractedFrom "05869.png" ;
                :extractionTimestamp "2025-12-15T12:36:00.568710" .

###  http://example.org/multimodal-taxonomy#semiotic_projection_1
:semiotic_projection_1 rdf:type :SemioticProjection ;
                rdfs:label "User projected onto the distressed man with blood as the speaker of the joke"@en ;
                rdfs:comment "The user is projected onto the visual material of the distressed man with blood, who is mapped as 'me' in the textual setup. The text 'my wife asked me...' directly deictically refers to the speaker, and the visual of the man embodies this 'me' who is caught in the absurd and taboo situation. The user identifies with the speaker experiencing the shock and embarrassment of giving an inappropriate response."@en ;
                :extractionMethod "llm_extraction_huggingface" ;
                :extractedFrom "05869.png" ;
                :extractionTimestamp "2025-12-15T12:36:00.568710" .

###  http://example.org/multimodal-taxonomy#toxicity_1
:toxicity_1 rdf:type :ToxicityAssessment ;
                rdfs:label "Harmful"@en ;
                rdfs:comment "The meme contains a crude, sexually explicit punchline that references a taboo subject involving incest, which is offensive and potentially distressing to many viewers. The humor is derived from shock value and gross-out comedy, relying on violating social norms and family taboos. While not targeting a specific protected group, the content is harmful due to its vulgar, crude, and potentially offensive nature."@en ;
                :extractionMethod "llm_extraction_huggingface" ;
                :extractedFrom "05869.png" ;
                :extractionTimestamp "2025-12-15T12:36:00.568710" .

###  http://example.org/multimodal-taxonomy#audience_id
:audience_id rdf:type :TargetCommunity ;
                rdfs:label "audience description"@en ;
                rdfs:comment "The target community is individuals who appreciate shock humor, gross-out comedy, and crude, taboo-breaking jokes. This includes viewers familiar with internet meme culture who enjoy humor derived from absurdity, sexual innuendo, and violating social norms. The meme is designed for an audience that finds humor in juxtaposing a serious question with an offensive, sexually explicit punchline, particularly those who are comfortable with vulgar language and family taboo violations as comedic devices."@en ;
                :extractionMethod "llm_extraction_huggingface" ;
                :extractedFrom "05869.png" ;
                :extractionTimestamp "2025-12-15T12:36:00.568710" .


